---
import DefaultLayout from '../default';

import HeroSection from './HeroSection.astro';
import Section from './Section.astro';
import IntroSection from './IntroSection.astro';
import AudienceSection from './AudienceSection.astro';
---

<DefaultLayout>
  <article class="pb-14">
    <HeroSection />
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto mt-24">
      <IntroSection />
      <AudienceSection class="mt-24" />
      <Section class="mt-24" title="值得买吗？">
        <p>购买《欧雷的破局之路》不是一次「消费」，而是对欧雷这个人进行「投资」，是否值得买确实需要认真评估下，下面给出一些参考。</p>
        <ul>
          <li>购买后可享受的权益</li>
          <li>欧雷是谁</li>
          <li>欧雷的理念是什么</li>
          <li>欧雷宇宙是什么</li>
        </ul>
        <p>已有 27 名「破局见证者」：头像列表</p>
      </Section>
    </div>
  </article>
</DefaultLayout>
